{
  "capability": "tag",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Tags",
  "description": "Values the hub holds for itself, under names a superuser gives them: a flag that is on or off, a number, a line of text, or one choice from a list. Tags are how screens and rules remember things and tell each other about them. They keep their values when the hub restarts.",
